Problem Identified

Creating a comic story manually requires several steps such as:

* Creating a story idea
* Developing characters
* Writing dialogues
* Creating narration
* Arranging the story into different comic panels
* Maintaining a proper story flow

Beginners and students may find these tasks time-consuming and difficult.

Proposed Idea

The proposed solution is ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator, a web-based application that uses Google Gemini AI to convert a simple story idea into a structured comic storyboard.

Target Users

* Students
* Teachers
* Beginner writers
* Content creators
* Comic enthusiasts

Main Idea

The user provides:

* Story idea
* Genre
* Characters
* Number of panels
* Target audience

The AI then generates:

* Comic title
* Logline
* Characters
* Scene descriptions
* Narration
* Dialogue
* Ending
* Moral

Expected Outcome

The final outcome is a complete multi-panel comic storyboard that can be viewed and downloaded as JSON or HTML.
